{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The everyday and extraordinary lives of women!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's exactly what it sounds like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes 75 illustrations that show women's everyday and extraordinary lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try a simple game, collect illustrations of women's everyday and extraordinary lives,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and enjoy this digital art book at your leisure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe illustrations and music used in this game were created by generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWe recommend using a controller when playing this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe controller display for this game is based on the Xbox controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game is not related to any real organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Do you want to see behind the mosaic?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annoying mosaic applied to illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to hit the button and hit the button and hit the button, with only your enthusiasm and desire to see the other side of the mosaic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game is a simple game where all you have to do is to hit the button repeatedly to erase the mosaic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's get rid of the mosaic now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Songs created with music generation AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have included many songs created with music generation AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of songs created with the latest technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will definitely be amazed at the high quality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878550?t=17